<title>USA: Cold Spring ESD, Calif., won by BancAmerica Sec..</title>
<headline>Cold Spring ESD, Calif., won by BancAmerica Sec..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>BancAmerica Sec. said it won $1.450 million of Cold Spring Elementary School District, Calif., unlimited tax general obligation bonds, 1996 Election, Series A.</p>
</text>
